[00:19.58]1. There is a way of peace,
[00:22.66]The way you’ve come to know.
[00:25.68]It is the way you learned,
[00:28.32]The way of long ago,
[00:31.22]The way that Jesus taught you
[00:34.82]When his voice you heard.
[00:37.38]This is the way of peace,
[00:40.74]Found in Jehovah’s Word.
[00:43.50](Chorus)
[00:43.96]This is the way to life; This is the way.
[00:49.86]Don’t look aside; Not for a moment stray!
[00:55.88]God’s voice is calling: ‘This is the way;
[01:01.54]Do not look back, for yes, this is the way.’
[01:20.40]2. There is a way of love,
[01:23.50]No need to look around.
[01:26.46]God’s voice has shown the way
[01:29.34]He lets himself be found.
[01:32.26]His love is full and good;
[01:35.24]His love is warm and true.
[01:38.28]This is the way of love;
[01:41.64]It touches all we do.
[01:44.46](Chorus)
[01:44.50]This is the way to life; This is the way.
[01:50.78]Don’t look aside; Not for a moment stray!
[01:56.74]God’s voice is calling: ‘This is the way;
[02:02.48]Do not look back, for yes, this is the way.’
[02:20.90]3. There is a way of life,
[02:24.26]No need to look behind.
[02:27.06]Our God has promised us:
[02:30.02]No better way we’ll find,
[02:33.02]No higher way to peace,
[02:36.04]No finer way to love.
[02:39.04]This is the way to life,
[02:42.10]Thanks to our God above.
[02:45.14](Chorus)
[02:45.26]This is the way to life; This is the way.
[02:51.62]Don’t look aside; Not for a moment stray!
[02:57.56]God’s voice is calling: ‘This is the way;
[03:03.38]Do not look back, for yes, this is the way.’
